%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: AlftandPt4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141421
    - rid: 4351268349337141422
    - rid: 4351268349337141423
    - rid: 4351268349337141424
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We've just about reached Blackreach...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141425
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What's that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141426
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Eh, don't worry about it. You'll see when we get there.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141427
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: First, just gotta open up that gate...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141428
    - rid: 4351268349337141429
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I pull the lever to open up the gate to the arena.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright Monika, through that gate is a serious fight.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141430
    - rid: 4351268349337141431
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There's going to be one of those Dwarven Centurions.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: The big golem guys, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141432
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, and I highly doubt that a single arrow is going to be able to take
      it down.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141433
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Not with our current equipment, at the very least.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So, is there something specific that we need to look out for?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141434
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's gonna have big hammers for arms, and can spray incredibly hot steam
      at us.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141435
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141436
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Please watch over us...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141437
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141438
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141441
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us enter the arena, awakening the centurion.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141442
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141443
    - rid: 4351268349337141444
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaaahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268349337141445
    - rid: 4351268372525613127
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's... the hard part... out of the way...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Is it too soon for another break...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613130
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Hm. While I'm pretty tuckered out myself, we <i>should</i> be able to
      pretty easily avoid any fighting in Blackreach.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And I'm pretty sure that there won't be any enemies in Mzark...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Nah, we should keep moving for now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613131
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, we should be able to avoid any fights that would be coming up,
      anyway.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I don't know {mc}, this place has been pretty cramped so far, so
      we'd have to be <i>really</i> sneaky-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613132
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, don't worry about it- you'll see...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613133
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Just as we climb up the stairs to the entrance to Blackreach, I notice
      the two NPCs that will fight among themselves emerge from the shadows.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613134
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I motion for Monika to stop and remain silent while the two of the duke
      it out.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613135
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: After a brief, and even, fight the two of them succumb to blood loss.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613136
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, now we can get into Blackreach.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I use the attunement sphere to open up the stairway that leads to Blackreach.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, a little hidden stairway. Neat.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613138
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us head down the stairway and into Blackreach.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613139
    - rid: 4351268372525613140
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh wow...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613141
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, Blackreach is pretty impressive when you see it for the first time.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The moment has passed, back to work!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613142
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us make our way forward into Blackreach.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613143
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613144
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wow... that's quite the impressive lamp!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613145
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep; a little artificial sun the Dwemer made so they could see better
      down here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613146
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Fun fact! If I hit that thing with a shout, it'll summon a dragon.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613147
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... why would you do that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I suppose the only practical purpose would be to get the dragon soul
      that comes with slaying it...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'But it does raise a pretty interesting question: how did the dragon
      get down here?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613148
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And why would it react to the resonance of a shout hitting the artificial
      sun?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's very likely that the Dwemer had <i>something</i> to do with it,
      but how and why?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613149
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The two of us spot some Falmer walking out of the structure.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613150
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess we'll have to think about it somewhere else; let's keep moving.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We make our way deeper into Blackreach.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I don't remember exactly where we're supposed to be going, but I'm pretty
      sure it's on the opposite end of where we came from.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613151
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, how long have we been down here?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613152
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't know...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We may, or may not, have gotten a <i>little</i> lost...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: If it's any consolation, we've managed to avoid any unpleasant encounters
      so far.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, that elevator should lead to Mzark.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I hope so...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613153
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613154
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, this <i>looks</i> like Mzark...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613155
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Would we be able to leave if it's not?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh? The claustrophobia kicking in?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613156
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: In all seriousness, there should be an exit to the surface from here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613157
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: As the two of us progress further, we come across a large dwemer-made
      sphere... thing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613158
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The one that specifically resides in Mzark.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Nice, for as much crap as I gave Monika, I'd rather not hang around any
      longer.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613159
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613160
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I plug the dwemer cube into its slot, ready to begin the "puzzle."
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613161
    - rid: 4351268372525613162
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'I get to work: pressing the third button (from left to right) until
      the second button becomes accessible.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613163
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Once the second is open, I press it until the first button is too.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: And with one press of the first button-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Elder Scroll revealed.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613164
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What does this machine even do, other than be a puzzle to reveal the
      Elder Scroll.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Because it didn't really seem that complex for something that would just
      guard a powerful artifact...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613165
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm pretty sure this thing was made to extract knowledge from the Elder
      Scroll, not just to store them.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613166
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Not entirely sure how concentrated starlight can do that, but starlight
      is specifically magical in this universe...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So I guess it's got something to do with that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, let's grab that Elder Scroll-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613167
    - rid: 4351268372525613168
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh dang, this thing's heavier than it looks...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613169
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The weight of knowledge is pretty heavy, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613170
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, real funny {mc}...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So are there words in this thing-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613171
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Monika starts to pull the Elder Scroll open-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika, NO!!!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613172
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What?!? What's wrong?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Do <NoiseText=3,1>NOT</NoiseText> read that scroll!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What would happen if I did?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613173
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Best-case scenario, you just go blind. Worst-case scenario you go blind
      <i>and</i> insane.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613174
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That's bad...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613175
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, so why are we grabbing this thing if we can't read it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613176
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The Elder Scrolls'' negative effects can be worked around in very specific
      circumstances:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613177
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you train with the Moth Priests in Cyrodiil, you can make preparations
      for a brief reading that will leave you drained.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You could also attract Ancestor Moths using a special kind of tree bark;
      those moths will protect your mind while you read.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: For this specific scroll, it is possible to read it safely up in the
      time-wound that's up at the top of the Throat of the World.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: There's a... time-wound up on the mountain where High Hrothgar is?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep. It was made when an Elder Scroll-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Pretty sure it was specifically this one...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, an Elder Scroll was used to banish Alduin forward in time, which
      caused the time-wound.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613178
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Where's the exit?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613179
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It should be just under this raised platform...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613180
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: An elevator leading to the surface should just be at the end of this
      hallway...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sure enough, after a brief walk, we find the elevator.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613183
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I pull the lever in the middle of floor, beginning the journey back to
      the surface.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613181
    - rid: 4351268372525613182
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ahh... fresh air!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613184
    - rid: 4351268372525613185
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I take a big swig of that fresh air myself, enjoying it despite how cold
      it is.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, how long <i>were</i> we down there?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613186
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I look up toward the sky, trying to get a read on what time it is.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It looks like it's night time already...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, there's a tent right there, so we can get our rest for the night.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You want to sleep with me that bad?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613187
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... could you not flirt with me for <i>five minutes</i>?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613188
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Ahaha!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Nah. I gotta stay at the top of my game for when we get out of here!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613189
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Seriously? You got someone you're interested in waiting for you back
      home?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Something like that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613190
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And I'm a close enough target that flirting with me would actually help
      with that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
